WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,240
Hey, poor Miko became part of their play.

2
00:00:02,240 --> 00:00:04,040
We also went to the school forum to anonymously break the news.

3
00:00:06,780 --> 00:00:08,620
Keke, how long will it take for you to come back?

4
00:00:08,820 --> 00:00:10,420
Can you bring me a lunch?

5
00:00:10,900 --> 00:00:15,180
Miko seems to have changed a lot these days, sorry Jingyi

6
00:00:15,180 --> 00:00:17,300
I'm still doing rehabilitation for the students who are waiting in line.

7
00:00:17,300 --> 00:00:18,700
Can you order takeaway yourself?

8
00:00:18,700 --> 00:00:19,700
Rejected again

9
00:00:19,900 --> 00:00:22,100
She feels uncomfortable because of that necklace

10
00:00:24,140 --> 00:00:26,420
News Are you going out to eat?

11
00:00:26,820 --> 00:00:27,820
Sorry to ask Jingyi

12
00:00:27,980 --> 00:00:29,820
After dinner, I’m going to watch a movie with my classmates

13
00:00:29,900 --> 00:00:33,020
I won't be back at noon. You can order takeout. That's fine.

14
00:00:33,140 --> 00:00:35,020
Have fun, okay?

15
00:00:35,220 --> 00:00:44,040
When I bring her food

16
00:00:44,040 --> 00:00:45,200
Thought I was a female subject?

17
00:00:45,320 --> 00:00:46,360
Fill her with this young lady

18
00:00:46,360 --> 00:00:47,960
Du Li, my feet are inconvenient

19
00:00:48,240 --> 00:00:49,320
I'm ordering takeout now

20
00:00:49,440 --> 00:00:51,800
Can you bring it up for me later? Sorry Jingyi

21
00:00:51,800 --> 00:00:52,760
I'm going out now

22
00:00:52,760 --> 00:00:58,380
I don’t believe you asked other classmates for help.

23
00:00:58,580 --> 00:01:00,540
Without them, I wouldn't be able to eat.
